 כך שרחמי אלוהים עולים על דרישת הדין, תוך שמירה על סדר מוסרי.  \n\n**Addressee:** individual → **Voice format:** ביבלייתי שלישי־איש (וַיִּשְׁמַע אֱלֹהִים...).\n\n<voice_hebrew>\nוַיֹּ֣אמֶר אֱלֹהִ֗ים זֹ֤את אֽוֹת־הַבְּרִית֙ אֲשֶׁר־אֲנִ֣י נֹתֵ֗ן בֵּינִי֙ וּבֵ֣ינֵיכֶ֔ם וּבֵ֛ין כׇּל־נֶ֥פֶשׁ חַיָּ֖ה אֲשֶׁ֣ר אִתְּכֶ֑ם לְדֹרֹ֖ת עוֹלָֽם׃\nוַיִּשְׁמַע אֱלֹהִים אֶת־קֹלוֹת הַבְּרִית וַיִּתֵּן אֶת־הָאוֹת בָּרָקִיעַ לְאֹת בְּרִיתוֹ עִם כׇּל־בָּשָׂר.\n</voice_hebrew>\n\n<voice_russian>\nИ сказал Бог: сей знак завета, который Я даю между Мне и вам, и между всеми живыми существами, которые с вами, на вечные поколения. И услышал Бог голос завета и дал знак в облаке, как знак завета Его с всем плотью.", "metadata": {"book": "Genesis", "trigger": "faithfulness", "behavior_type": "covenant", "outcome": "covenant", "severity": 3, "situation_id": "Genesis_9_12"}}
{"situation": "[Genesis 9:] וַיֹּ֥אמֶר אֱלֹהִ֖ים אֶל־נֹ֑חַ זֹ֤את אֽוֹת־הַבְּרִית֙ אֲשֶׁ֣ר הֲקִמֹ֔תִי בֵּינִ֕י וּבֵ֥ין כׇּל־בָּשָׂ֖ר אֲשֶׁ֥ר עַל־הָאָ", "think": "We need to follow the system instructions: produce exactly three blocks:\n\n1. Trigger: [type] etc.\n\n2. Covenant/pledge: [specific]\n\n3. Middat HaDin severity 1-5\n\n4. Middat HaRachamim activation? why?\n\n5. Mediator presence? effect on severity\n\n6. Jung archetype active? Bowlby attachment reaction?\n\n7. Resolution: balance chesed/din -> outcome\n\n8. Addressee: [prophet/nation/individual/unclear] -> format of answer.\n\nThen produce <voice_hebrew> block (Biblical Hebrew only) and <voice_russian> block (Synodal style). Must follow the pattern exactly.\n\nWe need to fill in each step with appropriate content based on given situation. Let's parse:\n\nTrigger: ביוזמת ה׳ | Behavior: ברית | Outcome: ברית | Severity: 3/5\nAddressee: individual\n\nCovenant context: ברית אברהם — זרע, ארץ, ברכת העמים (בר' יב, טו, יז)\n\nWe need to produce the three blocks.\n\nFirst block (analysis) includes fields:\n\n1. Trigger: ביוזמת ה׳\n2. Covenant/pledge: ברית עם נוח (ברית הקשת)\n3. Middat HaDin severity: 3/5\n4. Middat HaRachamim activation? why? Probably yes, because God shows mercy in establishing covenant after flood; so activate and reason: because of promise to preserve creation.\n5. Mediator presence? effect on severity: No mediator (no prophet). So severity remains at 3/5 (maybe no change).\n6. Jung archetype active? Oтец (Власть и закон) is active, given context of covenant law.\n7. Bowlby attachment reaction: Anxious-Ambivalent; God expects obedience and punishes breach but also shows mercy.\n8. Resolution: balance chesed/din -> outcome: The covenant stands as a sign of divine mercy (chesed) tempered by the warning that if the covenant is broken, judgment follows (din). So outcome: covenant established, promise to preserve earth, with both mercy and justice.\n\n9. Addressee: individual (Noah) => format: Divine 